# What the scripts here write and something else then carries: the icon and the
# bar logo are copied into Assets, and the two favicons are written into the Web
# template as data URIs. The copy in the repository is the one being used, so
# these are intermediates. jacquard-logo.svg is not among them -- the README
# serves that file itself.
icon.png
icon-android.png
logo-bar.png
favicon.png
favicon.svg

# The plate Jacquard > Capture Score Plane writes and the graphic cut out of it.
# The plate is an intermediate like the rest of this list; the graphic is not one,
# and it is still not committed -- the store listing lives in the store and not
# here, which is the argument the repository's own .gitignore makes for
# /metadata/ and /screenshots/.
plane.png
plane.txt
feature-graphic.png

# Left behind by importing jacquard_grid, which every script here does.
__pycache__/
